---
---
<div class="flex flex-col w-full">
  <!-- 11. DESKTOP FAQ (Two-Column Layout) -->
  <section class="w-full py-14 sm:py-24 lg:py-28 bg-surface">
    <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16">
        
        <!-- 4 cols left sticky -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col items-start">
          <span class="font-label text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] uppercase font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] sm:tracking-[0.22em] text-primary block mb-2">
            Common Queries
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-[44px] font-bold text-on-surface leading-tight mb-4 sm:mb-6">
            Questions?<br/>We Have Answers.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-6 sm:mb-8">
            Every site is unique. If you have specific queries regarding zoning, structural engineering, or turnkey contracts, speak directly with our principal desk.
          </p>
          <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 sm:px-6 py-3 sm:py-3.5 bg-surface-container-high hover:bg-surface-container-highest text-on-surface font-label text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors" href="/contact">
            Contact Our Team
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        
        <!-- 8 cols right accordion -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col divide-y divide-outline-variant/30">
          <div class="py-5 sm:py-6">
            <button class="w-full text-left flex justify-between items-center py-2 focus:outline-none cursor-pointer" onclick="this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('hidden'); this.querySelector('span:last-child').textContent = this.nextElementSibling.classList.contains('hidden') ? 'add' : 'remove';">
              <span class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface pr-4">What is turnkey construction?</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary flex-shrink-0">remove</span>
            </button>
            <div class="pt-2 sm:pt-3 pb-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Turnkey construction brings architectural design, municipal approvals, civil execution, interior millwork, and warranty handover under a single accountable contract. Paanya Empire takes full ownership of budget, timeline, and delivery, delivering a completed home ready for occupancy.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="py-5 sm:py-6">
            <button class="w-full text-left flex justify-between items-center py-2 focus:outline-none cursor-pointer" onclick="this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('hidden'); this.querySelector('span:last-child').textContent = this.nextElementSibling.classList.contains('hidden') ? 'add' : 'remove';">
              <span class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface pr-4">What services does Paanya Empire handle?</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary flex-shrink-0">add</span>
            </button>
            <div class="hidden pt-2 sm:pt-3 pb-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              We cover the entire architectural and structural lifecycle: soil investigations, schematic and 3D BIM design, sanction clearances, civil construction, electrical and plumbing infrastructure, custom cabinetry, smart home automation, and landscaping.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="py-5 sm:py-6">
            <button class="w-full text-left flex justify-between items-center py-2 focus:outline-none cursor-pointer" onclick="this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('hidden'); this.querySelector('span:last-child').textContent = this.nextElementSibling.classList.contains('hidden') ? 'add' : 'remove';">
              <span class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface pr-4">How is project cost calculated?</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary flex-shrink-0">add</span>
            </button>
            <div class="hidden pt-2 sm:pt-3 pb-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Following site evaluation and architectural schematics, we provide an itemized Bill of Quantities (BOQ). Costs are fixed against clear material specifications, preventing budget creep during construction.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="py-5 sm:py-6">
            <button class="w-full text-left flex justify-between items-center py-2 focus:outline-none cursor-pointer" onclick="this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('hidden'); this.querySelector('span:last-child').textContent = this.nextElementSibling.classList.contains('hidden') ? 'add' : 'remove';">
              <span class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface pr-4">How long does construction take?</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary flex-shrink-0">add</span>
            </button>
            <div class="hidden pt-2 sm:pt-3 pb-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              A standard custom villa (5,000 to 8,000 sq.ft.) typically completes within 12 to 16 months from statutory clearance. We provide a milestone-gated CPM schedule during the design phase.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 12. DESKTOP CONSULTATION & INQUIRY -->
  <section class="w-full py-14 sm:py-24 bg-surface-container-low">
    <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8">
      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-14 shadow-lg">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-14">
          
          <!-- Left 5 cols -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <span class="font-label text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] uppercase font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] sm:tracking-[0.22em] text-primary block mb-2">
                Let's Talk About What You're Building
              </span>
              <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-[44px] font-bold text-on-surface leading-tight mb-4 sm:mb-6">
                Let's Build Your Next Project.
              </h2>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm lg:text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-6 sm:mb-10">
                Tell us about your property and architectural vision. Our principal team will schedule a tailored feasibility review within 48 hours.
              </p>
              
              <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4 sm:space-y-5 text-sm text-on-surface mb-6 lg:mb-0">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4">
                  <div class="w-9 h-9 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary-fixed flex-shrink-0">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base sm:text-lg">call</span>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-on-surface-variant block">Phone Direct Desk</span>
                    <span class="font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm">+91 98765 43210</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4">
                  <div class="w-9 h-9 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary-fixed flex-shrink-0">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base sm:text-lg">mail</span>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-on-surface-variant block">Email Inquiries</span>
                    <span class="font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm">concierge@paanyaempire.com</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Right 7 cols form -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-7">
            <form class="flex flex-col space-y-4 sm:space-y-5" action="/api/enquiry" method="POST">
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-5">
                <div>
                  <label class="font-label text-xs uppercase font-semibold text-on-surface tracking-wider block mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">Full Name</label>
                  <input class="w-full h-11 sm:h-12 px-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low text-sm text-on-surface focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary outline-none transition-all" placeholder="e.g. Eleanor Vance" required type="text" name="name"/>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label class="font-label text-xs uppercase font-semibold text-on-surface tracking-wider block mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">Phone Number</label>
                  <input class="w-full h-11 sm:h-12 px-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low text-sm text-on-surface focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary outline-none transition-all" placeholder="+91 98765 43210" required type="tel" name="phone"/>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-5">
                <div>
                  <label class="font-label text-xs uppercase font-semibold text-on-surface tracking-wider block mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">Email Address</label>
                  <input class="w-full h-11 sm:h-12 px-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low text-sm text-on-surface focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary outline-none transition-all" placeholder="eleanor@domain.com" required type="email" name="email"/>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label class="font-label text-xs uppercase font-semibold text-on-surface tracking-wider block mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">Project Location</label>
                  <input class="w-full h-11 sm:h-12 px-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low text-sm text-on-surface focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary outline-none transition-all" placeholder="e.g. Jubilee Hills, Hyderabad" required type="text" name="projectLocation"/>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label class="font-label text-xs uppercase font-semibold text-on-surface tracking-wider block mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">Project Description</label>
                <textarea class="w-full h-28 sm:h-32 p-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low text-sm text-on-surface focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary outline-none transition-all resize-none" placeholder="Briefly describe your vision, plot size, or specific requirements..." required name="message"></textarea>
              </div>
              <button class="w-full h-12 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-label text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold rounded-lg shadow-xl shadow-primary/20 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer" type="submit">
                Submit Inquiry
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">send</span>
              </button>
            </form>
          </div>
          
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
